<section>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="InnerContents">
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-lg-8 col-md-8 txtPads">
                    <h3>Choicer</h3>
                    <!--<p>Allow Users to create tests in random format with or without timers. Moreover, User databases can be shared with anyone across the globe with or without secure passwords.</p>-->
                    <p>Choicer is a great application that uses a basic multiple choice format with or without passwords and timers. As with Quester and Wordutopia, Users can share tests with other Users including Study groups, specific business departments, friends and fellow hobbyists. Because tests are relayed back to Users in a random fashion the potential to cheat is made more difficult. And as with Quester and Wordutopia, test administrators can monitor the performances of all participants and so design subsequent tests that focus on incorrect answers. For a full list of features and functionality including how to access the free online forum, simply click on the DEMO section. Enjoy! </p>
                    <!--<a class="readBtn" href="#">Read More</a>-->
